Package: live-whisper
Version: 0.0.1-alpha-gnome-1
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: lszl84 <lszl84@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: dbus, gnome-shell (>= 45), ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-prefs
Homepage: https://github.com/lszl84/live-whisper
Description: Speech-to-text overlay for GNOME Shell
 Press a hotkey, speak, and the transcribed text is typed
 into the previously focused window. Uses Whisper.cpp for
 on-device speech recognition and a GNOME Shell extension
 for text injection.
